<http://data.silknow.org/object/b2e8a0db-9094-3a11-9bca-d84434e6f91f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Two pieces.  Brocaded in polychrome silks on a compound satin ground.  (b) has a wide satin stripe in the center shading from white through yellow to tan, with scattered small leaf motifs.  On either side, a leafy floral vine brocaded on a ribbed silk ground.  (a) brocaded with a symmetrical leafy floral vine, with a narrow tan satin stripe at each edge.  (b) has selvedge on one side of six cords, the other side turned in and basted.  Soiled, worn, holes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/b2e8a0db-9094-3a11-9bca-d84434e6f91f> .

